From 75ed6519c02fa8429eef2e8c294c346b7258bd5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanyog Kale <skale@habana.ai>
Date: Sun, 05 Jun 2022 16:20:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "[SW-77251] fit: add fit operations"

Revert rom recovery implementation for secured firmware update via
inband and OOB.

This reverts commit 7ceac47ef7656072555f463e912ba962509ee137.

Change-Id: Id8cbeb41a83bfdce1ce5f3cca0c516c34355e8f3
---

